                    <h3>一年检一次，安心你我他。</h3><p>天猫【瑞慈体检旗舰店】</p><p>瑞慈体检全国 70+ 门店通用，<strong>下单后未使用支持全额退款</strong>，且本次支持叠加 88VIP 消费券。</p><h2>全身检查</h2><p>含基础内外科检查、肝胆胰脾双肾前列腺彩超、肿瘤标志物 2 项、血 / 尿常规、肝功能 4 项、肾功能 3 项、血脂 2 项、空腹血糖、胸部 X 光、心电图等。</p><p>日常 1079 元，今日券后 277 元，88VIP <span class="font-color-red"><strong>实付 252 元</strong></span>。</p><p>9 月 30 日前体检评价再返 10 元，折合仅需 242 元：</p><dir><a contenteditable="false" href="https://uland.taobao.com/coupon/edetail?e=U1x7nqWhB%2FWlhHvvyUNXZfh8CuWt5YH5OVuOuRD5gLJMmdsrkidbOWBzzpT26idJhUED8MdcG25uo4DBMZFaAWB2iyjHaRTkl0dgKt8CyXFkLqVqkvp9I2H4nq83QycdRSHvQe2jOLZ9pbNCYX0I%2BPP%2BWUTgK%2F%2B0DI9LnV2RxzN7CtXivpqDNXwsxwL0%2FoFJwqAVLj8v3FUSwGdedzkKTBHtR5M9fhgNtsfGA5CFJLDe4LCSMIu01HLmoMDXvnqU7jKjAO7pxYgdIMeVz1KiUedUUfszYWxCgayeHsN6BwTWMtkn7Ps2tk30GF%2FAXMv9MN%2FVEVK8A2R%2BOHfs5nLQGA%3D%3D&amp;traceId=213e035617887696987078279e0e31&amp;&amp;union_lens=lensId:TAPI@1788769698@21075122_14ab_1a07afb83ca_be72@01" target="_blank"><span class="card main-site"><span class="card-logo"><img height="800" src="https://img.alicdn.com/bao/uploaded/i2/796659284/O1CN01N7qe9l2IS8EVkjj60_!!4611686018427383380-0-item_pic.jpg" title="每年一检更安心：瑞慈全身体检 242 元、增强版 449 元，彩超 + 肺部螺旋 CT+ 幽门螺杆菌" width="800" /></span><span class="card-info"><span class="card-title"><span class="mall-data">天猫</span><span class="card-name">瑞慈健康 优选 D 体检套餐</span></span><span class="card-abstract">全国 70+ 门店可用</span><span class="card-controls"><span class="price">券后 277 元</span><span class="card-btn-deep">领 753 元券</span></span></span></span></a></dir><dir><a contenteditable="false" href="https://uland.taobao.com/coupon/edetail?e=hDd6f2ts3oulhHvvyUNXZfh8CuWt5YH5OVuOuRD5gLJMmdsrkidbOWBzzpT26idJvv3xPifk2gdrV6NNxqOV%2BBWZiU5X4z5lWu5v70PX1GFu5kyqbEJRBrllS0lHjlCR2mwCY5fS7rVrTdT7cgXf6jgYSYpxmYtMsb%2Bvi71p7YhlXymvoVZzQ2APSRYsUsLv8Ms%2F2gjxVmCYwek19h0d0NQV3tBpdKHodxJgRmH6PTUPrRT%2FGlevSUzgKIk6XTsliqP6wveQFBWrBNRUyvxLOKjh80nnLovGv%2FMf0eKDDyP32D2Gqq%2BYKTIJYCSbU7yTT0gQVqlwDLVlBRYM90QVRw%3D%3D&amp;traceId=213e046c17887694069517178e0d99&amp;&amp;union_lens=lensId:TAPI@1788769407@212aa574_1489_1a07af71034_2829@01" target="_blank"><span class="card main-site"><span class="card-logo"><img height="800" src="https://img.alicdn.com/bao/uploaded/i1/796659284/O1CN01IUkcoM2IS82fDFAgJ_!!2-item_pic.png" title="每年一检更安心：瑞慈全身体检 242 元、增强版 449 元，彩超 + 肺部螺旋 CT+ 幽门螺杆菌" width="800" /></span><span class="card-info"><span class="card-title"><span class="mall-data">天猫</span><span class="card-name">瑞慈健康 深度体检套餐</span></span><span class="card-abstract">较上方多血脂 + 心肌酶</span><span class="card-controls"><span class="price">折后 297 元</span><span class="card-btn-deep">领 753 元券</span></span></span></span></a></dir><h2>增强版</h2><p>在“<strong>深度体检</strong>”的基础上（肝肾功能略有不同）男性增加：</p><ul class=" list-paddingleft-2"><li><p>肺部螺旋 CT 检查（价值 530 元，适合<strong>吸烟 / 炒菜做饭</strong>的小伙伴）</p></li><li><p>幽门血液抗体定量检查（价值 100 元）</p></li><li><p>甲状腺彩超 *（价值 80 元）</p></li></ul><p>日常 1246 元，今日券后 509 元，88VIP <span class="font-color-red"><strong>实付 449 元</strong></span>。</p><dir><a contenteditable="false" href="https://uland.taobao.com/coupon/edetail?e=y2trdDrZYlulhHvvyUNXZfh8CuWt5YH5OVuOuRD5gLJMmdsrkidbOWBzzpT26idJT%2F3DwWGA1aZmxgWEz4LAaYOnyXOL6FGGbwYgkZLq5KS8WSx7GfJ2JDM1ZeBVBGNuRSHvQe2jOLZ9pbNCYX0I%2BPP%2BWUTgK%2F%2B0DI9LnV2RxzN7CtXivpqDNc4UqLVl4rBH%2BMold3xTQXnM%2FqkOhugh%2FhHtR5M9fhgNtsfGA5CFJLDe4LCSMIu01HLmoMDXvnqU7jKjAO7pxYgdIMeVz1KiUY4IqUd14VPmcKtYTabqzwcE9wxjegkOok30GF%2FAXMv9MN%2FVEVK8A2R%2BOHfs5nLQGA%3D%3D&amp;traceId=213e050117887695384834590e0d62&amp;&amp;union_lens=lensId:TAPI@1788769538@0b56803f_1477_1a07af911ea_8760@01" target="_blank"><span class="card main-site"><span class="card-logo"><img height="800" src="https://img.alicdn.com/bao/uploaded/i4/796659284/O1CN01PSljsY2IS8BuuebO5_!!4611686018427383380-0-item_pic.jpg" title="每年一检更安心：瑞慈全身体检 242 元、增强版 449 元，彩超 + 肺部螺旋 CT+ 幽门螺杆菌" width="800" /></span><span class="card-info"><span class="card-title"><span class="mall-data">天猫</span><span class="card-name">瑞慈 增强版体检套餐</span></span><span class="card-abstract">增强版</span><span class="card-controls"><span class="price">券后 509 元</span><span class="card-btn-deep">领 587 元券</span></span></span></span></a></dir><p><strong>女性增加项目有所不同</strong>，具体详看宝贝详情页。</p><h2>升级版</h2><p>在“<strong>深度体检</strong>”的基础上增加肿瘤标志物 6 项、幽门螺杆菌抗体、甲状腺 / 输尿管 / 膀胱 / 乳房 / 妇科阴道彩超、颈椎 X 光检查。</p><p>日常 1429 元，今日券后 587 元，88VIP <strong><span class="font-color-red">实付 527 元</span>。</strong></p><dir><a contenteditable="false" href="https://uland.taobao.com/coupon/edetail?e=1qyTxHfOc6ylhHvvyUNXZfh8CuWt5YH5OVuOuRD5gLJMmdsrkidbOWBzzpT26idJnC54Upk6p2M9uWhTCEfrN%2F9HwqAFq%2BQKjfBQ5BLacgJu5kyqbEJRBrllS0lHjlCR2mwCY5fS7rVrTdT7cgXf6jgYSYpxmYtMsb%2Bvi71p7YhlXymvoVZzQ2APSRYsUsLv8Ms%2F2gjxVmCYwek19h0d0NQV3tBpdKHodxJgRmH6PTUPrRT%2FGlevSUzgKIk6XTsliqP6wveQFBWrBNRUyvxLOKjh80nnLovGv%2FMf0eKDDyP32D2Gqq%2BYKTIJYCSbU7yTT0gQVqlwDLVlBRYM90QVRw%3D%3D&amp;traceId=213e040617887695872786972e0f2b&amp;&amp;union_lens=lensId:TAPI@1788769587@213f7ce5_1ee6_1a07af9d096_bca3@01" target="_blank"><span class="card main-site"><span class="card-logo"><img height="800" src="https://img.alicdn.com/bao/uploaded/i1/796659284/O1CN01IUkcoM2IS82fDFAgJ_!!2-item_pic.png" title="每年一检更安心：瑞慈全身体检 242 元、增强版 449 元，彩超 + 肺部螺旋 CT+ 幽门螺杆菌" width="800" /></span><span class="card-info"><span class="card-title"><span class="mall-data">天猫</span><span class="card-name">瑞慈健康 深度体检套餐</span></span><span class="card-abstract">选择“升级版”</span><span class="card-controls"><span class="price">券后 587 元</span><span class="card-btn-deep">领 637 元券</span></span></span></span></a></dir><p><strong>增强版与升级版内容差异较大，小伙伴们可按需选择。</strong></p><p>如果又想要肿瘤标志物 6 项检测，又想加肺部螺旋 CT 检查，可购“升级版”后在门店体检时加项，肺部螺旋 CT 检查门店加项一般在 300 元左右。</p><ul class=" list-paddingleft-2"><li><p>胸部 X 光片：二维重叠图像，像把整个胸部压扁在一张照片上，前后组织会重叠在一起显示，适合常规筛查（查不出小结节）。</p></li><li><p>肺部螺旋 CT：三维断层图像，像把胸部切成薄片一层层看，无组织重叠，显示更清晰。</p></li></ul><p>* 如果想打司 *** 肽 / 替 ** 肽，不可只做甲状腺彩超，还要查甲功等多项，一定要去正规三甲医院咨询检查，谨遵医嘱。</p><p>** 身体不适请及时就医，不可只体检，医疗领域专业性强，就诊用药请到正规医疗场所。</p><ul class=" list-paddingleft-2"><li><p><span class="font-color-red"><strong>京东 618 无门槛红包</strong> </span>面额至高 26618 元，每天抽 3 次：<a href="https://u.jd.com/HrMFCj2" target="_blank"><strong>点此抽红包</strong></a></p></li><li><p><span class="font-color-orange"><strong>淘宝 618 无门槛红包</strong> </span>面额至高 26888 元，每天抽 1 次：<a href="https://s.click.taobao.com/YO13bql" target="_blank"><strong>点此抽红包</strong></a></p></li></ul><p class="ad-tips">广告声明：文内含有的对外跳转链接（包括不限于超链接、二维码、口令等形式），用于传递更多信息，节省甄选时间，结果仅供参考，IT之家包含外链的文章均包含本声明。</p><div class="tagging1">【广告】</div>
